                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That reduces anxiety; tranquilizing"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "anxiolytic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0abc40ab-4643-36c1-8d02-c01cc76eba3a",
                                        "entry_id": "17f30184-f73b-3aa2-ba1a-64f5b44b1b02",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A drug prescribed for the treatment of symptoms of anxiety."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "da33c529-7b38-46ef-8919-53eb27b0d7d9",
                        "source_entry_id": "ef9b40d2-0c8d-3528-aace-d09cacabcda4",
                        "source_sense_id": "f4e56729-b1e6-3bbc-bd43-6fc1cc4f648b",
                        "target_lang_word": "anxiogenic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anxiogenic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b12cbd13-f33f-312c-98d3-f151a4a861d5",
                                        "entry_id": "0ecbac20-0784-38be-a640-e37cfe471bf3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Causing anxiety, or pertaining to the causing of anxiety."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "987106c0-57bf-47fd-942f-4d332e2ba4a6",
                                                "sense_id": "b12cbd13-f33f-312c-98d3-f151a4a861d5",
                                                "text": "A CRF antagonist, -helical CRF(9-41), can also attenuate the anxiogenic behavioral effects of HU-210."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01151f4e-6397-4162-875e-8acc67530873",
                                                "sense_id": "b12cbd13-f33f-312c-98d3-f151a4a861d5",
                                                "text": "Increases in dopamine efflux in the NAS cannot simply be seen as equivalent to drug reward, because aversive stimuli, such as foot shock, and anxiogenic drugs, such as FG 7142 and beta-CCE (which are not self-administered), have exactly the same neurochemical effect (3 )."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92602a14-4f10-43cf-901d-3b2aabf66d7a",
                                                "sense_id": "b12cbd13-f33f-312c-98d3-f151a4a861d5",
                                                "text": "Central injection of substance P or related peptide agonists induces conditioned place aversion and produces an anxiogenic profile on the elevated plus maze, implying that activation of central substance P pathways is aversive (5 )."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "634fc66f-f650-4b4e-a0fd-1dd21955ac9d",
                                                "sense_id": "b12cbd13-f33f-312c-98d3-f151a4a861d5",
                                                "text": "Thus, self-directed behavior increases after anxiogenic drug treatment but decreases after anxiolytic drug treatment (29 )."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2cadad8-3077-4051-ac75-cb68825b89af",
                                                "sense_id": "b12cbd13-f33f-312c-98d3-f151a4a861d5",
                                                "text": "This piece will perform a micro-excavation of these toplayers of the literary soil to suggest anxiogenic literature has the potential not only to adumbrate the post-apocalypse, a common theme in contemporary literature, but also to anticipate the post-Anthropocene."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "anxiogenic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "027269fc-f45c-3580-aa26-f0ded3a033be",
                                        "entry_id": "ed02536f-46ae-338f-b967-a62739b9b4e4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An anxiogenic drug: a drug that causes anxiety."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "832c34b7-9c3c-48d8-9915-4c7159743938",
                        "source_entry_id": "ef9b40d2-0c8d-3528-aace-d09cacabcda4",
                        "source_sense_id": "f4e56729-b1e6-3bbc-bd43-6fc1cc4f648b",
                        "target_lang_word": "anxiolytique",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anxiolytique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "688535b9-c94c-3745-9551-158b30def89c",
                                        "entry_id": "ae304aa7-0908-307e-b722-20ab4ae56fe7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Propre à combattre l’anxiété ou l’angoisse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0220cf93-4a1b-4fcd-8ee1-bbde3eb73c9b",
                                                "sense_id": "688535b9-c94c-3745-9551-158b30def89c",
                                                "text": "Si les fabricants vantent ses propriétés anxiolytiques, anti-inflammatoires, neuroprotectrices et antalgiques, l’association invite à en nuancer la fiabilité."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "anxiolytique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63fe3eff-a9e9-3c18-affe-5633be75a85f",
                                        "entry_id": "d72b741c-a7b2-3b8c-a352-a0fad421861b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Médicament contre l’anxiété ou l’angoisse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2802cd48-ff72-4abc-a9c4-8d58b81b2cd0",
                                                "sense_id": "63fe3eff-a9e9-3c18-affe-5633be75a85f",
                                                "text": "Autrefois les poulets mettaient trois mois à être adultes ; aujourd’hui entre l’œuf et le poulet vendu en hypermarché s’écoulent seulement 42 jours dans des conditions atroces (25 bêtes par mètre carré, nourries aux antibiotiques et anxiolytiques)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5efdd9b4-7286-4d7f-bf7f-4bb237fc3eb8",
                                                "sense_id": "63fe3eff-a9e9-3c18-affe-5633be75a85f",
                                                "text": "Le médecin m’examina et s’alarma de ma faiblesse, il me prescrivit des médicaments pour une forme sérieuse d’arthrose, des antidépresseurs, des anxiolytiques, des vitamines."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17edefcd-61c0-4893-8e4d-8c4ccc297398",
                                                "sense_id": "63fe3eff-a9e9-3c18-affe-5633be75a85f",
                                                "text": "En arrivant aux urgences, il avait encore la trace d’un puissant anxiolytique et de plusieurs grammes d’alcool dans le sang."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8868385-b845-4cf4-b703-de6ca25d7583",
                                                "sense_id": "63fe3eff-a9e9-3c18-affe-5633be75a85f",
                                                "text": "Le contact avec la douce fourrure angora de Pupuce, lapine géante, agit comme un anxiolytique et apaise cet enfant atteint de polyhandicaps."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
